  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given function is\r\n$$\r\nf(x)=x^{2}+b x+c\r\n$$\r\nIt is a quadratic equation in $x$. So, we will get a parabola either downward or upward.\r\n\r\nHence, it is a many one mapping and not onto mapping. Hence, it is neither one-to-one nor onto mapping.",
